  "description": "Discover the pinnacle of modern living at Roselawn. This stunning, two-bedroom apartment offers a superb east-facing aspect with stunning views over Dublin Bay and represents a unique opportunity to reside in a community designed for the future, right in the heart of South Dublin.\nApartment Highlights:\nExpansive Open-Plan Living: A beautifully designed living and dining area features a sleek kitchen, creating the perfect environment for relaxing or entertaining.\nPrivate East-Facing Balcony: Enjoy spectacular views over Dublin Bay and extend your living space outdoors with balcony access from the living area. \nTranquil Double Bedrooms: A spacious retreat with ample storage and floor to ceiling windows offering the same stunning Bay Views.\nSuperior Connectivity: Each apartment is equipped with Virgin Media fibre-optic cabling for seamless, superfast broadband subject to setting up your own account with Virgin Media.\nExclusive Resident Amenities:\nWellness Suite: Stay active and centred in the state-of-the-art private gym and dedicated yoga studio.\nResidents' Lounge & Pavilion: Unwind in the chic lounge with complimentary tea and coffee, or host events in the distinctive glazed garden pavilion.\nProfessional Workspaces: Achieve perfect work-life balance in the dedicated coworking space with free WiFi or book the private function room for meetings.\nA Location Without Rival: Embrace a \"15-minute city\" lifestyle in the heart of the South County Dublin and next to Sandyford Business District, a thriving hub of over 1,000 companies. Your commute is a thing of the past.\nBenefit from unbeatable transport links, including direct access to the N11 QBC and just 15 minutes from both the LUAS and DART.",
